<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>kaki narase sonzai wo</b></font></font></font>

4
00:00:02,770 --> 00:00:05,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>rock away your existence</b></font></font></font>

5
00:00:02,770 --> 00:00:05,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>koko ni iru to</b></font></font></font>

6
00:00:02,770 --> 00:00:05,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>shouting that you are here</b></font></font></font>

7
00:00:05,650 --> 00:00:11,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>arata na tabi ga ima hajimaru</b></font></font></font>

8
00:00:05,650 --> 00:00:11,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>a new journey begins now</b></font></font></font>

9
00:00:22,210 --> 00:00:28,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>kawari yuku kisetsu no naka wo ikinuku tabi ni bokura</b></font></font></font>

10
00:00:22,210 --> 00:00:28,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>as we survived through the changing seasons</b></font></font></font>

11
00:00:28,170 --> 00:00:33,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>chie to tsuyosa wo te ni ireta kedo JUST LOOKS LIKE SURVIVAL GAME</b></font></font></font>

12
00:00:28,170 --> 00:00:33,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>we gained knowledge and strength (just looks like a survival game)</b></font></font></font>

13
00:00:33,800 --> 00:00:36,510
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>nagareteku jikan no naka ni</b></font></font></font>

14
00:00:33,800 --> 00:00:36,510
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>but the forgotten memories</b></font></font></font>

15
00:00:36,510 --> 00:00:39,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>okizari ni shita omoi wo</b></font></font></font>

16
00:00:36,510 --> 00:00:39,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>of the feelings abandoned within the flows of time</b></font></font></font>

17
00:00:39,470 --> 00:00:44,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>wasureta koto sura wasurete ita</b></font></font></font>

18
00:00:39,470 --> 00:00:44,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>have also been lost</b></font></font></font>

19
00:00:45,600 --> 00:00:51,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>kuzure kaketa toki kodoku wo shitte</b></font></font></font>

20
00:00:45,600 --> 00:00:51,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>when sinking down we learned loneliness</b></font></font></font>

21
00:00:51,110 --> 00:00:55,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>deaeta bokura hitori ja nai</b></font></font></font>

22
00:00:51,110 --> 00:00:55,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>but now we've met each other we are no longer alone</b></font></font></font>

23
00:00:55,860 --> 00:01:01,450
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>sarake dase kanjou wo banjou no omoi wo</b></font></font></font>

24
00:00:55,860 --> 00:01:01,450
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>unveil your feelings those high emotions</b></font></font></font>

25
00:01:01,450 --> 00:01:06,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>namidame ga unmei wo kaete yuku</b></font></font></font>

26
00:01:01,450 --> 00:01:06,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>those tears will change your fate</b></font></font></font>

27
00:01:06,870 --> 00:01:09,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>yami ni uchi narase kodou wo</b></font></font></font>

28
00:01:06,870 --> 00:01:09,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>pound your heartbeat against the darkness</b></font></font></font>

29
00:01:09,790 --> 00:01:18,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>kitto aeru yo onaji itami no hata no moto de</b></font></font></font>

30
00:01:09,790 --> 00:01:18,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>we're sure to meet under the same flag of pain</b></font></font></font>

31
00:01:44,290 --> 00:01:49,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Natsuhiboshi, why are you so red?</font>

32
00:01:50,130 --> 00:01:55,380
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Because I had a sad dream last night</font>

33
00:01:56,090 --> 00:02:01,890
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">My eyes are red
From the tears I shed</font>

34
00:02:01,970 --> 00:02:07,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Swollen as I cried</font>

35
00:02:38,130 --> 00:02:38,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey!</font>

36
00:02:39,090 --> 00:02:41,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Neji! Naruto!</font>

37
00:02:43,430 --> 00:02:44,350
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What happened to those guys?</font>

38
00:02:44,850 --> 00:02:46,640
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It seems they were attacked
by the Shinobi in question...</font>

39
00:02:46,890 --> 00:02:48,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So he appeared again?</font>

40
00:02:48,430 --> 00:02:51,230
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He took... he took Sumaru away.</font>

41
00:02:51,480 --> 00:02:53,230
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What? He took Sumaru?!</font>

42
00:02:53,820 --> 00:02:54,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yeah!</font>

43
00:02:54,860 --> 00:02:58,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Anyway, helping the guys who are
down comes first!</font>

44
00:02:59,070 --> 00:03:00,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We'll split up and carry them!</font>

45
00:03:00,820 --> 00:03:01,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Got it...</font>

46
00:03:02,030 --> 00:03:02,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Roger!</font>

47
00:03:10,830 --> 00:03:11,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Mizura...</font>

48
00:03:17,000 --> 00:03:17,960
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto!</font>

49
00:03:19,630 --> 00:03:21,930
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">They were attacked by
the Shinobi in the mask!</font>

50
00:03:22,220 --> 00:03:24,890
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There are no external injuries...
They're just unconscious.</font>

51
00:03:33,400 --> 00:03:34,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What about the others?</font>

52
00:03:35,150 --> 00:03:37,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Lee and Tenten are carrying them
here now.</font>

53
00:03:38,320 --> 00:03:39,150
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I see...</font>

54
00:03:40,320 --> 00:03:41,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Then Sumaru as well...?</font>

55
00:03:43,660 --> 00:03:45,450
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He was taken away by
the masked Shinobi.</font>

56
00:03:45,580 --> 00:03:46,740
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm sorry...</font>

57
00:03:47,030 --> 00:03:49,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He escaped into the Valley of Death...</font>

58
00:03:49,950 --> 00:03:51,040
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We couldn't go after him.</font>

59
00:03:52,870 --> 00:03:53,920
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The Valley of Death?!</font>

60
00:04:02,050 --> 00:04:04,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Did he inhale the gas from
the Valley of Death?</font>

61
00:04:05,390 --> 00:04:09,020
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No... I put him into a state of
suspended animation beforehand,</font>

62
00:04:09,390 --> 00:04:10,930
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">so there was no effect on his body.</font>

63
00:04:11,140 --> 00:04:14,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I understand using Sumaru
to lure that person...</font>

64
00:04:15,270 --> 00:04:17,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But to use a child
from our same village...</font>

65
00:04:17,730 --> 00:04:20,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Is it enough to make you feel ill at ease?</font>

66
00:04:21,530 --> 00:04:23,740
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We're comrades who have
already dirtied our hands...</font>

67
00:04:23,950 --> 00:04:25,780
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What're you doing talking nice now?!</font>

68
00:04:26,910 --> 00:04:28,910
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We'll make those Hidden Leaf kids
believe that</font>

69
00:04:29,160 --> 00:04:33,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sumaru's kidnapping was
the work of that person...</font>

70
00:04:33,620 --> 00:04:38,340
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">After we've taken back the star,
we can leave the cleanup to them.</font>

71
00:04:42,360 --> 00:04:46,570
<font face="Iwata Gyousho Pro-Kami B" size="45" color="#f5f5f5">The Price for the Secret Technique,</font>

72
00:04:42,360 --> 00:04:46,570
<font face="Iwata Gyousho Pro-Kami B" size="45" color="#f5f5f5">Kujaku Myouhou</font>

73
00:04:50,890 --> 00:04:54,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Mizura isn't feeling well
and is taking a break from his training...</font>

74
00:04:57,150 --> 00:04:58,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Byakugan!</font>

75
00:05:04,030 --> 00:05:04,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What's this...?!</font>

76
00:05:11,200 --> 00:05:11,950
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Mizura!</font>

77
00:05:13,200 --> 00:05:13,910
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You okay?</font>

78
00:05:14,540 --> 00:05:15,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You still need to rest...</font>

79
00:05:16,460 --> 00:05:18,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I must not rest at a time like this...</font>

80
00:05:21,420 --> 00:05:22,710
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I understand how you feel...</font>

81
00:05:23,260 --> 00:05:24,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But you shouldn't push yourself too hard!</font>

82
00:05:26,180 --> 00:05:28,510
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm fine... I can walk by myself...</font>

83
00:05:41,900 --> 00:05:44,030
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Mizura! See, didn't I tell you?!</font>

84
00:05:44,820 --> 00:05:46,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm okay by myself!</font>

85
00:06:05,090 --> 00:06:07,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Mother... Father!</font>

86
00:06:14,020 --> 00:06:17,230
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Mother! Father!</font>

87
00:06:19,850 --> 00:06:22,230
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Do not cry, Sumaru.</font>

88
00:06:23,070 --> 00:06:28,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Your parents protected the star
and protected the village admirably.</font>

89
00:06:28,910 --> 00:06:32,160
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sumaru... Look up at the sky and watch.</font>

90
00:06:32,780 --> 00:06:37,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There is a treasure you can see only
in the Village Hidden in the Stars.</font>

91
00:06:38,040 --> 00:06:40,460
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If you were born as a Shinobi,</font>

92
00:06:40,630 --> 00:06:44,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">for the sake of protecting this village,
for the sake of protecting the star,</font>

93
00:06:44,550 --> 00:06:45,590
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">become strong!</font>

94
00:06:45,920 --> 00:06:49,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Like your father and your mother... Okay?</font>

95
00:06:57,890 --> 00:06:59,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Lord... Hoshikage...</font>

96
00:07:15,200 --> 00:07:17,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yeah, this looks good!</font>

97
00:07:23,170 --> 00:07:24,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto...</font>

98
00:07:24,960 --> 00:07:26,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">At this rate, Mizura will die!</font>

99
00:07:29,880 --> 00:07:32,510
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I felt a chakra disturbance
and looked into it.</font>

100
00:07:34,680 --> 00:07:36,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Despite him lying quietly,</font>

101
00:07:37,010 --> 00:07:39,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">his chakra was being activated
to the utmost limit.</font>

102
00:07:40,560 --> 00:07:43,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If that keeps up, he'll be killed
by his own chakra.</font>

103
00:07:52,360 --> 00:07:54,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That could never be...!</font>

104
00:07:55,660 --> 00:07:56,780
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There's no mistake.</font>

105
00:07:57,280 --> 00:07:57,950
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But...!</font>

106
00:07:58,580 --> 00:08:00,080
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's because of the star training.</font>

107
00:08:02,960 --> 00:08:06,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The star has the power
to activate chakra.</font>

108
00:08:06,920 --> 00:08:12,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">However, many Shinobi are unable
to control the amplification,</font>

109
00:08:12,170 --> 00:08:15,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">their bodies break down
and it leads to death.</font>

110
00:08:16,680 --> 00:08:19,060
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">In the middle of this training,
Mizura also...</font>

111
00:08:20,600 --> 00:08:23,980
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The Third Hoshikage terminated
training utilizing the star</font>

112
00:08:24,020 --> 00:08:26,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">due to the large amount of casualties.</font>

113
00:08:27,060 --> 00:08:28,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Then why again?</font>

114
00:08:28,940 --> 00:08:31,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Lord Akahoshi,
the current leader of the village,</font>

115
00:08:31,650 --> 00:08:35,160
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">decided to resume the training
half a year ago.</font>

116
00:08:35,280 --> 00:08:36,620
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Something so dangerous!</font>

117
00:08:36,660 --> 00:08:38,450
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We'll make him stop right now!</font>

118
00:08:38,780 --> 00:08:43,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Those born and raised in this village
do not fear the star training!</font>

119
00:08:43,660 --> 00:08:45,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Why would you...?</font>

120
00:08:45,920 --> 00:08:49,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If they can complete the training
by themselves</font>

121
00:08:49,250 --> 00:08:51,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">and make every effort possible for
the village as a Hidden Star Shinobi...</font>

122
00:08:52,470 --> 00:08:56,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Even if the body were to be destroyed,
they would be satisfied.</font>

123
00:09:03,890 --> 00:09:04,980
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's just...</font>

124
00:09:23,150 --> 00:09:23,930
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Go!</font>

125
00:09:27,300 --> 00:09:30,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Notice my chakra... Natsuhi!</font>

126
00:09:48,460 --> 00:09:52,840
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hotarubi... Please protect the star,
protect Sumaru...</font>

127
00:10:14,700 --> 00:10:15,960
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Akahoshi's chakra...</font>

128
00:10:44,440 --> 00:10:49,330
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Please use this until you get better...
I'm sure you will!</font>

129
00:10:50,780 --> 00:10:53,070
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Thanks, Naruto...</font>

130
00:10:58,770 --> 00:11:01,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But I won't...</font>

131
00:11:13,550 --> 00:11:15,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It seems his condition has stabilized...</font>

132
00:11:16,300 --> 00:11:18,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Everyone seems okay for the time being.</font>

133
00:11:18,660 --> 00:11:21,510
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It still doesn't sit right with me...</font>

134
00:11:21,990 --> 00:11:26,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Mizura and Hokuto, they're all thinking
earnestly of the village.</font>

135
00:11:26,760 --> 00:11:28,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Especially that Sumaru guy.</font>

136
00:11:28,300 --> 00:11:30,600
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He thinks of the village
more than anyone.</font>

137
00:11:34,600 --> 00:11:35,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What do you mean...?</font>

138
00:11:37,300 --> 00:11:39,380
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If it were for the sake
of protecting the village</font>

139
00:11:39,470 --> 00:11:41,450
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">and the special comrades around me...</font>

140
00:11:41,990 --> 00:11:47,240
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I would've gotten impatient,
wanting to get strong quickly as well.</font>

141
00:11:48,380 --> 00:11:50,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yeah... That's right...</font>

142
00:11:51,160 --> 00:11:51,930
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yes...</font>

143
00:11:53,800 --> 00:11:56,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Well, this isn't the time to
be saying stuff like that.</font>

144
00:11:56,550 --> 00:11:59,510
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The unforgivable one is that star thief!</font>

145
00:11:59,750 --> 00:12:04,640
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But, there wouldn't be any suffering
from training if they didn't use the star.</font>

146
00:12:05,400 --> 00:12:06,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I think so too.</font>

147
00:12:08,480 --> 00:12:12,040
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If they have the star, everyone
would train for the sake of the village.</font>

148
00:12:12,300 --> 00:12:14,420
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But if they do train,
then their bodies get...</font>

149
00:12:14,440 --> 00:12:17,950
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Jeez, I don't know what to do!</font>

150
00:12:18,070 --> 00:12:22,980
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Our mission is to protect the star. Our
first priority is to get back the star.</font>

151
00:12:23,700 --> 00:12:26,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We shouldn't be meddling in
the matters that follow!</font>

152
00:12:27,100 --> 00:12:28,120
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's right...</font>

153
00:12:28,240 --> 00:12:28,960
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Okay.</font>

154
00:12:29,680 --> 00:12:30,840
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Got it!</font>

155
00:12:31,340 --> 00:12:34,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Lee and Tenten, you guys search
around the village chief once more!</font>

156
00:12:35,150 --> 00:12:36,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What? Again?</font>

157
00:12:36,560 --> 00:12:40,630
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Why did the flying Shinobi escape
to the dangerous Valley of Death?</font>

158
00:12:41,230 --> 00:12:42,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Even though he got the star,</font>

159
00:12:42,660 --> 00:12:44,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">why did he go so far as
to take Sumaru away?</font>

160
00:12:44,940 --> 00:12:46,780
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Come to think of it... Why is that?</font>

161
00:12:47,950 --> 00:12:50,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The quality of chakra of
the one who took the star</font>

162
00:12:50,570 --> 00:12:52,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">and the one who took Sumaru away
were completely different.</font>

163
00:12:52,460 --> 00:12:54,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— What?!
— Say what?!</font>

164
00:12:54,840 --> 00:12:57,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's right...
There are two masked Shinobi!</font>

165
00:12:58,340 --> 00:13:00,070
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What does that mean?</font>

166
00:13:00,500 --> 00:13:04,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">In my opinion, there's more to
this mission than meets the eye.</font>

167
00:13:18,880 --> 00:13:23,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">As usual, impressive Ninja Art: Kujaku,
Lady Natsuhi.</font>

168
00:13:34,500 --> 00:13:36,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Where is he...? Where's Sumaru?!</font>

169
00:13:37,390 --> 00:13:40,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Before that, I'll have you return
the star to me...</font>

170
00:13:40,850 --> 00:13:42,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'll trade it for Sumaru!</font>

171
00:13:42,760 --> 00:13:43,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The star first!</font>

172
00:13:44,260 --> 00:13:45,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I refuse!</font>

173
00:13:45,340 --> 00:13:48,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Then I'll take it back by force
if I have to!</font>

174
00:13:49,890 --> 00:13:51,070
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What's so funny?!</font>

175
00:13:51,470 --> 00:13:55,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Akahoshi...
You're no competition to me.</font>

176
00:13:55,560 --> 00:13:57,600
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Even after you left the village,</font>

177
00:13:57,690 --> 00:14:01,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">a few of us who were interested
continued training in secret!</font>

178
00:14:02,860 --> 00:14:04,570
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You think you have completed
the star training</font>

179
00:14:04,610 --> 00:14:05,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">by training on your own?</font>

180
00:14:06,200 --> 00:14:09,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Verify with your own eyes whether
or not I'm no competition!</font>

181
00:14:10,740 --> 00:14:12,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Ninja Art: Kujaku!</font>

182
00:14:13,120 --> 00:14:14,240
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Beast!</font>

183
00:14:19,120 --> 00:14:21,710
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Such a folly... I have no choice.</font>

184
00:14:22,420 --> 00:14:24,840
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Ninja Art: Kujaku... Beast!</font>

185
00:14:30,430 --> 00:14:31,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Wha...?!</font>

186
00:14:40,440 --> 00:14:41,810
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">To think she'd be this tough...</font>

187
00:14:42,730 --> 00:14:44,780
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yotaka! Shisou!</font>

188
00:14:47,150 --> 00:14:48,590
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Go!
— Yes, sir!
— Yes, sir!</font>

189
00:14:49,990 --> 00:14:51,950
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What're you thinking, Akahoshi?!</font>

190
00:14:53,280 --> 00:14:56,910
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'll have you play along with me
a little while longer... Lady Natsuhi.</font>

191
00:14:59,210 --> 00:15:00,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What is it?</font>

192
00:15:01,040 --> 00:15:02,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">A flow of massive chakra...</font>

193
00:15:03,090 --> 00:15:03,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Is it him?!</font>

194
00:15:04,590 --> 00:15:05,590
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No mistake!</font>

195
00:15:06,380 --> 00:15:07,630
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh?! Who is it?!</font>

196
00:15:09,430 --> 00:15:10,630
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Our helper from the Leaf...</font>

197
00:15:10,800 --> 00:15:13,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The Shinobi who seized the star
has appeared!</font>

198
00:15:13,550 --> 00:15:15,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Lord Akahoshi is now delaying
that person...</font>

199
00:15:15,930 --> 00:15:17,640
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Please fight with us!</font>

200
00:15:17,890 --> 00:15:19,940
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">All right! Let's hurry!</font>

201
00:15:24,440 --> 00:15:27,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The enemy's power is mighty
and Lord Akahoshi alone cannot...</font>

202
00:15:27,780 --> 00:15:29,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's all he can do to delay the enemy.</font>

203
00:15:29,740 --> 00:15:31,740
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Right. Leave it to us!</font>

204
00:15:37,120 --> 00:15:38,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It seems nobody's here.</font>

205
00:15:39,460 --> 00:15:41,420
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It seems they've gone out...</font>

206
00:15:41,790 --> 00:15:43,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There's a faint presence
inside the residence.</font>

207
00:15:44,540 --> 00:15:47,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Now's our chance. Let's infiltrate!</font>

208
00:15:47,300 --> 00:15:47,960
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Right!</font>

209
00:15:48,050 --> 00:15:50,340
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Ninja Art: Phantom Jutsu!</font>

210
00:15:50,470 --> 00:15:51,840
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What?! Lee?</font>

211
00:15:52,090 --> 00:15:54,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Since when could you use ninjutsu...?</font>

212
00:15:55,390 --> 00:15:58,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Tenten! It's okay. There's nobody in here!</font>

213
00:15:58,890 --> 00:16:01,140
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey, that's not ninjutsu!</font>

214
00:16:09,570 --> 00:16:10,530
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Kind of...</font>

215
00:16:10,690 --> 00:16:11,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Suspicious, eh?</font>

216
00:16:35,680 --> 00:16:37,640
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Well, I guess I can do it later.</font>

217
00:16:47,060 --> 00:16:49,230
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It seems to be a medical room...</font>

218
00:16:49,730 --> 00:16:51,780
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Somebody's being laid down in a bed.</font>

219
00:16:52,110 --> 00:16:52,950
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I wonder who it is?</font>

220
00:16:56,110 --> 00:16:56,910
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's...!</font>

221
00:16:59,330 --> 00:17:00,160
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sumaru!</font>

222
00:17:07,040 --> 00:17:09,670
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Why did you make Sumaru and
the others do that star training?</font>

223
00:17:11,130 --> 00:17:13,630
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You should've been told by
the Third Hoshikage</font>

224
00:17:13,720 --> 00:17:15,340
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">about how dangerous that training is!</font>

225
00:17:16,720 --> 00:17:20,220
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You yourself are the answer to that!</font>

226
00:17:20,560 --> 00:17:21,270
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What?!</font>

227
00:17:21,770 --> 00:17:23,890
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That chakra is wonderful!</font>

228
00:17:24,600 --> 00:17:26,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It would make for great fighting strength</font>

229
00:17:26,480 --> 00:17:29,570
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">if we had one hundred, no,
even ten Shinobi like you!</font>

230
00:17:29,980 --> 00:17:32,530
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The likes of the Five Great Hidden
Villages would be no match for us</font>

231
00:17:32,570 --> 00:17:33,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">even if they all ganged up on us!</font>

232
00:17:34,110 --> 00:17:35,570
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's still not too late.</font>

233
00:17:35,900 --> 00:17:39,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Let's make this village into
an invincible Hidden Star Village!</font>

234
00:17:44,410 --> 00:17:46,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It hurts... It hurts...</font>

235
00:17:46,920 --> 00:17:48,710
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">My body feels like it is on fire!</font>

236
00:17:48,790 --> 00:17:50,040
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Help me...</font>

237
00:17:50,130 --> 00:17:52,420
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I must train... Star training...</font>

238
00:17:53,550 --> 00:17:56,840
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— That's enough... That's enough.
— For the sake of Hidden Star Village...</font>

239
00:17:57,510 --> 00:18:00,220
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There's no need to do
such painful training!</font>

240
00:18:01,930 --> 00:18:05,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That sorrow must not be repeated...</font>

241
00:18:05,640 --> 00:18:08,230
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If you're saying you're going to
continue this any further...!</font>

242
00:18:15,820 --> 00:18:19,240
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Wait! If I die, Sumaru will also die!</font>

243
00:18:22,200 --> 00:18:24,080
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You can't do it! Natsuhi!</font>

244
00:18:24,370 --> 00:18:28,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sumaru, who is more important
than your life, is in my hands!</font>

245
00:18:39,640 --> 00:18:41,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There he is!
He's moving in on Akahoshi!</font>

246
00:18:42,140 --> 00:18:44,640
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">All right!
I won't let him get away this time.</font>

247
00:18:44,770 --> 00:18:47,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Wait! He's not an opponent
you can take on from the front.</font>

248
00:18:48,390 --> 00:18:49,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I've got a plan.</font>

249
00:18:49,650 --> 00:18:50,310
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">A plan...?</font>

250
00:18:50,520 --> 00:18:54,230
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'll stop his chakra,
so I leave the rest to you!</font>

251
00:18:54,900 --> 00:18:58,150
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Indeed, the situation will get worse
if we're too slow.</font>

252
00:18:59,200 --> 00:19:01,240
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Got it! Be careful, Naruto!</font>

253
00:19:01,530 --> 00:19:03,370
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">All right! Let's go!</font>

254
00:19:03,410 --> 00:19:05,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Multi Shadow Clone Jutsu!</font>

255
00:19:07,370 --> 00:19:09,920
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Let's go!</font>

256
00:19:11,330 --> 00:19:12,460
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You again?!</font>

257
00:19:24,550 --> 00:19:26,140
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's more than I imagined.</font>

258
00:19:26,180 --> 00:19:28,140
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's impossible from the front, after all.</font>

259
00:19:31,600 --> 00:19:32,270
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What?!</font>

260
00:19:33,400 --> 00:19:34,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Where's the real body?!</font>

261
00:19:36,320 --> 00:19:36,980
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh, no!</font>

262
00:19:38,860 --> 00:19:39,740
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I get it.</font>

263
00:19:40,110 --> 00:19:42,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">When controlling massive chakra,</font>

264
00:19:42,240 --> 00:19:45,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">less attention is paid to the area around
the main body in spite of everything...</font>

265
00:19:45,740 --> 00:19:46,910
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Good thinking, Naruto!</font>

266
00:19:49,540 --> 00:19:51,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He... He did it...</font>

267
00:20:03,050 --> 00:20:03,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">A woman...?!</font>

268
00:20:08,390 --> 00:20:11,140
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The Hidden Leaf Kid has done it...</font>

269
00:20:11,560 --> 00:20:13,940
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I can find the star if I take the time...</font>

270
00:20:14,060 --> 00:20:17,020
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But now's my only chance
to defeat Natsuhi!</font>

271
00:20:17,320 --> 00:20:22,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">As long as she interferes, I won't be able
to carry out my ambitions!</font>

272
00:20:22,650 --> 00:20:24,950
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Ninja Art: Kujaku!</font>

273
00:20:25,160 --> 00:20:26,370
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Beast!</font>

274
00:20:27,870 --> 00:20:29,450
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto! Look out!</font>

275
00:20:31,870 --> 00:20:32,620
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Shoot!</font>

276
00:20:35,670 --> 00:20:36,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto!</font>

277
00:20:47,140 --> 00:20:48,600
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Something the matter, Mizura...?</font>

278
00:20:49,680 --> 00:20:51,270
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No... It's nothing...</font>

279
00:20:53,390 --> 00:20:54,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto...</font>

280
00:20:56,770 --> 00:20:57,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Mother...</font>

281
